    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d302-a3">

                <pb facs="0580" n="510" sameAs="frus:frus1883/pg510"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 3.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Colonel Irvine to Mr.
                            White.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Northwest Mounted Police Headquarters</hi>,<lb/><hi
                                rendition="#italic">Regina</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1883-05-25"><hi rendition="#italic">May</hi>
                            25, 1883</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I inclose herewith copy of a communication
                    from the officer commanding United States troops at Fort Assinniboine, Montana,
                    to Superintendent Shurtleff; also a copy of the last-named officer’s reply
                    thereto. I further inclose copy of a communication from Superintendent Shurtleff
                    relating to a raid made by our Indians on J. G. Baker &amp; Co.’s herd in
                    Montana.</p>
                <p>I have, &amp;c.,</p>
                <closer><signed>A. G. IRVINE,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Commissioner.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
